@dsh-external/dsh-image-gen README · 接入契约（写给网关）：只要你的网关支持 OpenAI Images API 形状即可接入：

```
POST {baseUrl}/images/generations
Authorization: Bearer <API Key>
{ "model": "...", "prompt": "...", "n": 1, "size": "1024x1024", "quality": "high" }

返回 URL 而非 `b64_json` 的网关暂不支持（欢迎 PR）。

@dsh-external/dsh-image-gen README · 行为边界：- **付费且非幂等**：超时或网络歧义失败后不会自动重试——重试请手动发起
- **一次一张**：单次调用只生成一张图
- **不动主模型**：生图网关独立配置，不影响 DeepSeek Harness 的聊天模型路由

@dsh-external/dsh-image-gen README · Gateway contract：Any gateway speaking the OpenAI Images API shape works:

```
POST {baseUrl}/images/generations
Authorization: Bearer <API Key>
{ "model": "...", "prompt": "...", "n": 1, "size": "1024x1024", "quality": "high" }

Gateways returning a URL instead of `b64_json` are not supported yet (PRs welcome).

@dsh-external/dsh-image-gen README · Behavior：- **Paid & non-idempotent**: no automatic retries after timeouts or ambiguous failures — retry manually
- **One image per call**
- **Never touches the chat model**: the image gateway is separate config, DeepSeek Harness model routing is untouched

@dsh-external/dsh-image-gen README · FAQ：**Q: “No gateway base URL configured”?** A: None of the four config sources is set — run `dsh_image_gen_config` to see what is missing.

**Q: Settings changes not applied?** A: Settings-page saves apply instantly; env vars need a `dsh` restart.

**Q: My gateway model name has a prefix (e.g. `azure_openai/...`)?** A: Put the exact model name your gateway expects into the Model field — it is passed through verbatim.
